00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:46.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Bouchard, a une autre vision.

00:00:44.678 --> 00:00:47.414 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ANDRÉE BOUCHARD, candidate à la

00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:48.415 size:53% position:73% line:53%
