00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:58.191 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour des nouvelles industries.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:01:01.394 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Sa priorité : Séduire les

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:02.362 size:53% position:73% line:53%
