00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.431 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Moi je vise l'équilibre.

00:01:02.696 --> 00:01:06.232 size:53% position:73% line:53%
L'équilibre entre un

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:08.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
