00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:14.307 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu

00:01:12.606 --> 00:01:15.308 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ces dernières années, c'est

00:01:13.607 --> 00:01:16.343 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la guerre politique que

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:19.145 size:53% position:73% line:53%
