00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:06.292 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Elle a d'ailleurs suspendu Alain

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:10.063 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Laplante 95 jours en 2020,

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:11.064 size:53% position:73% line:53%
