00:02:10.397 --> 00:02:14.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On a l'impression qu'à Saint-

00:02:11.398 --> 00:02:16.336 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Jean-sur-Richelieu, c'est

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:17.337 size:53% position:73% line:53%
