00:02:55.542 --> 00:03:02.482 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici, Kim Vermette,

00:02:56.543 --> 00:03:02.482 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, À Saint-Jean-sur-

